    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Escape\u00a0</strong>is a rogue-like arcade shoot-'em-up game where survival is the only mission. Forget peaceful space exploration\u2014you're dodging obstacles and blasting alien ships coming at you from every direction. Level up, stack power-ups, and upgrade to take on tougher enemies. Got what it takes to survive the chaos of space? Prove it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Survival:</strong> Fight through infinite waves of enemies and bosses, where every run delivers new twists and turns to keep you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Ship:</strong> Pick from 4 unique ships (Perhaps some secret ones, as well?), each with their own style and stats. Ready for action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Up:</strong> Stack over 15 power-ups to boost your ship\u2019s firepower, speed, and abilities. Mix and match for ultimate combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arm Yourself:</strong> From missiles to laser beams, you\u2019ve got the weapons to turn alien ships into space dust.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade System:</strong> Earn credits as you battle through waves, then spend them on a variety of permanent upgrades to boost your firepower, health, and much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
